OL,3,AGovernment preparing to publish more
OL,4,AMandelson papers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther documents relating to the
OL,7,Fappointment of Lord Mandelson as US
OL,8,Fambassador are expected to be published
OL,9,Fby the government later today.
OL,11,FSome documents were published earlier
OL,12,Fthis year after MPs voted to compel the
OL,13,Fgovernment to release them, but others
OL,14,Fwere withheld at the request of the
OL,15,FMetropolitan Police, who are
OL,16,Finvestigating the former ambassador.
OL,18,FThe Met has since informed the
OL,19,Fgovernment the documents can be
OL,20,Fpublished without prejudicing their
OL,21,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
