OL,3,ADR Congo demands answers over Ugandan
OL,4,Ageneral's threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Republic of Congo has
OL,7,Fsummoned Uganda's top diplomat in
OL,8,FKinshasa over social media posts by
OL,9,FUganda's military chief, Gen Muhoozi
OL,10,FKainerugaba, who is also the
OL,11,Fpresident's son.
OL,13,FIn a series of X posts, Gen Kainerugaba
OL,14,Fappeared to support a rebel takeover of
OL,15,FWalikale, a mineral-rich territory in
OL,16,Feastern DR Congo. He insisted that
OL,17,FUganda's military involvement was
OL,18,Fpurely driven by security concerns.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
